  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poultry diseases detection, Biosecurity in Farms/Live birds Markets/Sampling procedures for lab tests.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goals were intended to reinforce and strengthen existing ability for surveillance and diagnosis of avian diseases including highly pathogenic avian influenza, exotic Newcastle Disease, Gumboro, Salmonella and Mycoplasma as well as to reinforce and strengthen understanding of best practices for biosafety and biosecurity. The training was held at the Central Veterinary Laboratory of Ouagadougou (CVL).</narrative>
  </description>
